			"uuid": "bca5f523-8eba-42a1-aa97-4d7f3aebe4dd",
			"title": "Add a bomb",
			"description": "Sounds like an easy static hazard to add. Was wondering if, to incentivise pausing, you're able to see the time left before the bomb explodes on a billboard to better plan your time? No idea.",
