		},
		{
			"uuid": "3be0ebde-f941-4e39-b9e9-ababa08876fb",
			"title": "(Wall)jumping while dashing cancels speed",
			"description": "Very very tough fix, I ran out of time to look at this, its hard because wall jumping is entirely programmed to be a set force away from the wall and up, maybe I could change it to add it to the current velocities instead, but idk.",
			"category": "e87a803b-1fa7-4b22-adaf-7646a0ee04c3",
