		},
		{
			"uuid": "5402b4b4-8ccf-4f2f-a1cb-3e475f4976ce",
			"title": "Make Tutorial 3",
			"description": "You will have to put a unlock_area at the start of tutorial 3 that gives everything other than pause time.  3 should then teach the player about pause time and fighting mechanics.",
			"category": "14bc8dfc-382b-4779-a576-ff565ed63cbd",
			"steps": []
		},
		{
			"uuid": "90f71804-98cb-48e0-98c1-ffeb74751ef4",
			"title": "READ ME",
			"description": "If you use the unlock area, YOU MUST MUST MUST MUST MUST, make the collision shape unique each time.  If you dont after copying it you will edit it for all previous implementations of those copies you make. DONT LEARN THE HARD WAY HERE.\n\nThe unlock area gates tutorial progression.  Tutorial levels get the root node assigned to the groups level, and tutorial.  if they have both the unlock areas are needed to progress abilities.  If they only have level you will get everything.",
			"category": "14bc8dfc-382b-4779-a576-ff565ed63cbd",
			"steps": []
		},
